            "text": "{\"task\":{\"created_at\":\"2026-10-28T10:18:53.923026Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-28T10:18:53.923026Z\",\"org_id\":\"01a18202-4425-752f-876c-95bdd1b4de21\",\"project_id\":\"01a18204-e5f4-7142-8598-a96148ff2fa2\",\"id\":\"01a18205-1661-70a6-90f8-17e39a9c9524\",\"title\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo $WALK_MARKER` in…\",\"display_index\":4,\"status\":\"pending\",\"kind\":\"agent\",\"member_id\":\"01a18202-4434-7480-8ee3-0402fe9bb475\",\"automation_id\":null,\"runtime_group_id\":\"01a18204-f40f-73f9-a059-d9e4a1a4cf06\",\"runtime_id\":\"01a18204-f6d6-7598-8524-4e5c0273eaf6\",\"is_archived\":false,\"started_at\":null,\"completed_at\":null,\"last_user_message_at\":\"2026-10-28T10:18:53.923910Z\",\"metadata\":{\"error\":null,\"suite\":\"walk\",\"agent_name\":\"scripted\",\"task_prompt\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo $WALK_MARKER` in the shell and reply in one short sentence.\\n\\n<<SCRIPT {\\\"reply\\\":\\\"Echoed the message through hello-mcp and wrote it to the outputs file.\\\",\\\"tools\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hello-mcp_echo\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"message\\\":\\\"hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"write\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Echo: hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"bash\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"command\\\":\\\"echo $WALK_MARKER\\\"}}]}>>\",\"active_run_id\":\"01a18205-1661-70a6-90f8-17e2f20549d1\",\"latest_run_id\":\"01a18205-1661-70a6-90f8-17e2f20549d1\",\"crash_restarts\":null,\"history_recall\":null,\"conversation_id\":\"01a18205-166